WEBVTT

00:00:55.836 --> 00:01:01.076
I saw a farmer in my village
sitting next to a farm stream

00:01:01.076 --> 00:01:03.476
and eating something from the ground.

00:01:03.516 --> 00:01:05.596
Something did not seem right.

00:01:05.596 --> 00:01:09.276
I walked up to him
to see what was going on.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:14.156
I was shocked to see him eat mud.

00:01:14.956 --> 00:01:16.116
Mud.

00:01:16.596 --> 00:01:20.236
Brown, soft mud from the stream.

00:01:21.116 --> 00:01:22.756
I was afraid he might die.

00:01:22.756 --> 00:01:23.956
I yelled at him.

00:01:23.996 --> 00:01:26.156
"What is this stupid mud-eating business?"

00:01:28.956 --> 00:01:32.036
He looked at me helplessly and said,